<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Power Restored Notification</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f4f6f9;
            color: #333333;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 40px auto;
            background: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 8px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
            border-top: 5px solid #2ecc71; /* Success Green Accent Color */
        }
        .header {
            background-color: #e8f8f5;
            padding: 30px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .header h1 {
            margin: 0;
            color: #27ae60;
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }
        .content {
            padding: 30px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        .greeting {
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }
        .info-table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin: 25px 0;
            background-color: #fafafa;
            border-radius: 6px;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .info-table td {
            padding: 12px 15px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #eeeeee;
        }
        .info-table td:first-child {
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #666666;
            width: 40%;
        }
        .info-table td:last-child {
            color: #2c3e50;
        }
        .info-table tr:last-child td {
            border-bottom: none;
        }
        .note-box {
            background-color: #f9f9f9;
            border-left: 4px solid #3498db;
            padding: 15px;
            margin-top: 20px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-style: italic;
        }
        .footer {
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
            padding: 20px;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #7f8c8d;
            border-top: 1px solid #eeeeee;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="container">
        <!-- Header Section -->
        <div class="header">
            <h1>✅ Power Restored</h1>
        </div>

        <!-- Main Body Content -->
        <div class="content">
            <div class="greeting">Dear Customer,</div>
            <p>We glad to inform you that the power supply has been successfully restored in your area (<strong><%= areaName %></strong>).</p>

            <!-- Restoration Details Table -->
            <table class="info-table">
                <tr>
                    <td>Affected Area</td>
                    <td><%= areaName %></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Restoration Time</td>
                    <td style="color: #27ae60; font-weight: bold;"><%= restorationTime %></td>
                </tr>
            </table>

            <!-- Conditional Note Section -->
            <% if (restorationNote) { %>
                <div class="note-box">
                    <strong>Update Note:</strong> <%= restorationNote %>
                </div>
            <% } %>

            <p>Thank you for your immense patience and cooperation during the service outage. If you are still experiencing any localized issues, please contact our support desk.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Footer Section -->
        <div class="footer">
            <p>This is an automated notification from the Power Grid Management System.</p>
            <p>&copy; <%= year %> All Rights Reserved.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
